  "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt asks for multi-factor authentication enabled but the ground truth UserPool sets no MfaConfiguration (only an unused mfaConfiguration parameter), so no MFA check is written. Temporary-password and verification strings come from prompt. Refresh validity units not checked (default days). IAM grants are bound to the authenticated role: a Cognito-trusted role whose trust policy does not restrict it to the unauthenticated amr. A role with no amr condition still counts, because some templates omit it (so an unauthenticated role with no amr is not told apart)."
}
